{"last_link_id": 13, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [5], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [319, 182], "pos": [-222, 510], "widgets_values": ["请提供此图像的详细描述。如果图片中有您熟悉的人物，如名人、电影人物或动画人物，请直接使用他们的名字。描述应尽可能详细，结果用中文输出，把图像有文字的都要识别出来，但不应超过500字。"], "inputs": [{"name": "ref_image", "link": 4, "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "RH_Captioner", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "pipeline", "links": [1], "label": "pipeline", "type": "QWEN_PIPELINE", "localized_name": "pipeline"}], "size": [186.96835327148438, 26], "pos": [553, 181], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "QwenImageModelLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "QwenImageModelLoader"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 270], "pos": [1389, 179], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 7, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 7, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 270], "pos": [1745, 175], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 11, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 10, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [6], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [344, 216], "pos": [138, 139], "widgets_values": ["这是一张以春天和正式商务元素为主题的图片。画面主体是一位穿着深色西装的人物，西装的质感细腻，上面带有少量雨滴，显示出雨中初春的氛围。在西装的胸前口袋里插着一束盛开的樱花，花朵粉白色，花蕊清晰可见，枝条纤细，凸显出生机与春意。\n\n画面的下方部分可以看到一只棕色皮制公文包，表面同样附着着露珠，手柄采用了金属扣件，做工精致，彰显质感。皮包与背景的西装形成了颜色和材质上的对比，但整体搭配和谐。\n\n图片上方加入了一段手写风格的中文文字：“把春天，缝进西装口袋里！”。文字采用白色书写，其中“春天”两字的旁边点缀了绿色的叶子图案，增加活力感，与樱花相呼应。\n\n背景为自然模糊的绿色植物和浅粉色花朵，给人一种清新宁静的感觉，暗示这是春日里的背景环境。樱花瓣在空气中飞舞，为动态的意境增色。\n\n整张图片传递出一种春天生机勃勃的氛围，同时兼顾都市生活的精致感。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 5, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [140, 26], "pos": [239, -21], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 12, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 11, "type": "easy cleanGpuUsed", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy cleanGpuUsed"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "reel", "links": [10], "label": "reel", "type": "Reel", "localized_name": "reel"}], "size": [270, 238], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [1015, 212], "widgets_values": ["原图", "洗图", "image3", "image4", 1024, 8], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 8, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 9, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"widget": {"name": "image1_text"}, "name": "image1_text", "label": "image1_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image1_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "image2_text"}, "name": "image2_text", "label": "image2_text", "type": "